          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Fal 1:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini ikawa, Ahabu alipokufa, mfalme wa Moabu akamwasi mfalme wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akatoka wakati ule ule mfalme Yoramu katika Samaria, akawahesabu Israeli wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.22.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Fal 22:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaenda akatuma kwa Yehoshafati mfalme wa Yuda, akasema, Mfalme wa Moabu ameniasi; je! Utakwenda pamoja nami tupigane na Moabu? Akasema, Nitakwenda; mimi ni kama wewe, watu wangu ni kama watu wako, farasi zangu ni kama farasi zako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akauliza, Njia ipi tuiendee? Akajibu, Njia ya jangwa la Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.11.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 11:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi mfalme wa Israeli akaenda, na mfalme wa Yuda, na mfalme wa Edomu; wakazunguka mwendo wa siku saba; wala hapakuwa na maji kwa jeshi, wala kwa wanyama waliowafuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:10"
