                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha akamwambia mfalme wa Israeli, Nina nini mimi nawe? Uende kwa manabii wa babayo, na manabii wa mamayo. Mfalme wa Israeli akamwambia, La, sivyo; kwa kuwa BWANA amewakutanisha hawa wafalme watatu, awaue mkononi mwa Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
