              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Wamoabi wote waliposikia ya kuwa wafalme hao wamekwea ili kupigana nao, walijikusanya pamoja, wote wawezao kuvaa silaha, na wenye umri zaidi, wakasimama mpakani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakaamka asubuhi na mapema, na hilo jua likameta-meta juu ya maji, na Wamoabi wakayaona yale maji yaliyowaelekea kuwa ni mekundu kama damu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakasema, Ndiyo damu hii; bila shaka hao wafalme wameharibika, wamepigana kila mtu na mwenziwe; basi sasa, enyi Wamoabi, nyara hizo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata walipokuja matuoni kwa Israeli, Waisraeli wakainuka wakawapiga Wamoabi, hata wakakimbia mbele yao; wakaendelea wakiwapiga-piga Wamoabi hata kwao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.16.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 16:7",
                  "type": "text"
